+## Request 25: Polish renderInvoiceText
+✅ DONE — Enhanced renderInvoiceText to show line discounts, vouchers, due dates, and payment history.
+- Enhanced renderInvoiceText(invoice) in src/render.js to show:
+  - Line-level discounts: Shows "(discount: -€amount)" under each line with discountPercent > 0
+  - Voucher: Shows "Voucher (code): -€amount" before total (only if amount > 0)
+  - Due date: Shows "Due: YYYY-MM-DD" after total (only if dueDate exists)
+  - Payment history: Shows "Paid: €amount" as last line (only if payments exist)
+  - Payment amounts are summed from payments array
+- Output format example:
+  ```
+  INV-2026-0001
+  Customer Name
+  qty x Item Name @ Price = Total
+    (discount: -€amount)
+  VAT: €amount
+  Voucher (CODE): -€amount
+  Total: €amount
+  Due: 2026-10-21
+  Paid: €amount
+  ```
